layer=com_16
hide=yes
textfont=fontmetrics_26
fontmono=no
text=Each week, you'll be able to get your hand on one of four outfits by turning squares and revealing chinchompas.<br><br>Plan your hunt carefully and find each of the outfit pieces before the week is up.<br><br>Use one free go each day and 20 tokens per try after that. If you want to turn tiles without using tokens you can pay a Bond then open them all for free!<br><br>And don't worry too much should you miss an outfit, they'll be available to purchase with tickets via the Chinchompa map after the hunt period is over.
textalignh=centre
textalignv=centre
colour=0x000000

